manual login claude-sub and codex-sub
why OAuth against the vendor, which an offline run cannot answer
step build both exes, then for each: set TOFU_CLAUDE_TOKEN_URL and TOFU_CODEX_TOKEN_URL to a local stub that answers the token exchange
step tofu login llm claude-sub --paste with a mock code, in a home made fresh in the run, and the same for codex-sub
step tofu login --status --json on both builds, diff after masking the token expiry
step drive chat --source claude-sub and --source codex-sub on a cassette, both builds, diff

manual live sub turns
why a real wire to the vendor
step point TOFU_CLAUDE_BASE_URL and TOFU_CODEX_SOCKET_URL at a recording stub and run tofu run with the same task on both builds, diff the requests the stub saw
step the orchestrator runs one real claude-sub session in the interface on the candidate build at the end

manual usage and quota
why the vendor usage endpoints
step stub the usage URLs, run tofu usage --json on both builds, diff
step drive quota --quota inputs/quota.json is in the catalog and covers the footer and /status

manual openrouter, meta, typesafe and brave key check
why each key check is a network call
step openrouter and meta: point TOFU_OPENROUTER_API_URL and TOFU_META_BASE_URL at a stub answering 200, run tofu login llm openrouter and tofu login llm meta with a fake key on both builds, diff
step typesafe and brave have no URL override, so only the refused path is in the catalog (login/typesafe key, login/brave key)

manual jev paths
why every jev answer is a classifier call
step start a local stub answering the jev wire and set TOFU_JUDGE_ENDPOINT to it with a fake key in a fresh home
step run tofu judge, tofu check, tofu sift --arm jev, tofu run --gate enforce and drive with a gate ask on both builds, diff
step the dry runs and the no-key answers are in the catalog (judge/dry run, judge/no key, check/no key, sift/jev no key, run/gate enforce without a classifier)

manual learn scan model step
why the scan calls a model and has no cassette path
step run tofu learn on a fixed project on both builds with a live key, compare the proposals by hand

manual browser and chrome extension host
why Chrome and HKCU are the person's own
step start a fake relay on HOME/.tofu/browser/relay.sock as cmd/tofu/browser_test.go does
step run tofu browser tabs, read, observe, click, open, close and batch on both builds against it, diff
step never run browser install, uninstall or profile login against the real machine

manual drive desk and flows 12 to 14
why tofu-desktop renders pixels
step run tofu serve --stdio --cassette with the desk core cassettes on both builds and diff the transcripts; the serve catalog already covers every method
step render the desk on both builds and compare screenshots by eye

manual update install, models reload and query.update
why the release and model registries are on the network
step serve a copy of the release json on a local port, set TOFU_UPDATE_API and TOFU_UPDATE_TARGET to a scratch copy of the exe, run tofu update on both builds, diff
step set TOFU_MODELS_REGISTRY_URL to a local copy of the registry, run tofu models reload --json on both builds, diff after sorting the provider rows

manual ctrl+g editor and the clipboard
why ctrl+g opens EDITOR and /copy writes the person's clipboard
step set EDITOR to a script that appends a line to its file, drive ctrl+g by hand in a terminal on both builds, compare the composer
step paste is in the catalog through drive --clipboard (drive/flow 10-steer-image)
